保留 Gob 缓存格式。跨进程锁文件 .lock 保留在缓存旁，句柄关闭/进程退出自动释放内核锁，
不应按“文件存在”判断仍被占用。原坏缓存显式报错并保留，不能自动当空锁处理。
The Gob format is unchanged. The persistent .lock sidecar holds an OS lock only while its handle
is locked; closing or process exit releases it. File existence is not ownership. Corrupt caches
fail explicitly and are retained rather than silently becoming an empty lock set.

KV 保存和 JSON 快照均以临时文件完整写入后原子替换；保存/发布失败返回非零退出码。
锁竞争及 Windows 替换重试共用五秒截止。JSON 查询失败也不得输出成功的空列表。
KV and JSON snapshots publish by atomic replacement after complete temporary-file writes.
Persistence/publication failures exit nonzero. Lock contention and Windows replacement retries
share a five-second deadline. JSON query failures must not masquerade as successful empty lists.

未修复的外部 Git LFS 不遵守新旁路锁；多个旧写入者仍可能破坏其共享缓存。
Win64 执行真实 CLI 并发和失败回归；Linux/macOS 仅交叉编译，未声明运行时验收。
Unpatched external LFS tools do not honor the sidecar; multiple legacy writers remain unsafe.
Win64 runs real CLI concurrency/failure tests; Linux/macOS are cross-compiled, not runtime-verified.

